ttp://example.org/fhir/trust-ai-transparency/CodeSystem/trust-ai-artifact-type-cs model-card}\">AI Model Card</span></p><p><b>date</b>: 2026-03-01 10:00:00+0000</p><p><b>description</b>: </p><div><p>Synthetic model card for an AI system generating diagnostic reports from structured clinical input.</p>\n</div><blockquote><p><b>content</b></p><h3>Attachments</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>ContentType</b></td><td><b>Url</b></td><td><b>Title</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>text/html</td><td><a href=\"https://example.org/model-card/diagnostic-assist\">https://example.org/model-card/diagnostic-assist</a></td><td>DiagnosticAssist AI Model Card</td></tr></table></blockquote></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
